'''One-Eyed Asuka''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event|Neon Genesis Evangelion]] collaboration event. It was added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]]. This unit is a variant of [[Kasli the Bane (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasli the Bane]] with various different attributes.

