==Trivia==
*Unlike Kasli variants, One-Eyed Asuka's stats do not change between forms.
*The evolved form references how Asuka was infected by the [[The 9th Angel (Uber Rare Cat)|Ninth Angel]] in both the appearance and description of the unit; the eyepatch on "her left eye" held "dark magics," a reference to how she unleashes Angel blood and uses its power.

